# Per-user tracked emotions & target behaviors

## Tracked emotions (Today intensity rows)

- Server: `user_preferences.diary_emotions` via Settings + `GET/PUT /api/preferences`
- Defaults backfilled from `DIARY_CARD_EMOTIONS` for existing users
- Today / diary card forms read the current user’s list — do not hardcode the six defaults in new UI

## Target behaviors

- Server: `user_preferences.target_behaviors` via Settings + macros/`LedgerPrefs`
- Client cache: `localStorage` key `ledger_target_behaviors`
- Empty server list imports from localStorage once; adding on Today/check-in still syncs to the server
- Use `templates/macros/target_behaviors.html` + `LedgerPrefs`
